{"seq":4,"slug":"problem-classification","title":"题目分类体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/algorithms/competitive-programming/problem-classification","wordCount":1014,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"题目分类体系\">题目分类体系</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>题目分类体系是将算法问题按照数据结构、算法范式和问题模式进行系统化归类的方法论。建立清晰的分类能力意味着：当你看到一道新题时，能够快速将其归入已知类别，调用对应的解题模板和思维框架。这种&quot;模式匹配&quot;能力是竞赛高手和面试达人的核心素质，也是系统化提升算法水平最高效的途径。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[&quot;题目分类体系&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;按数据结构&lt;br/&gt;数组/树/图/堆&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;按算法范式&lt;br/&gt;贪心/DP/搜索/分治&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; D[&quot;按问题模式&lt;br/&gt;求最值/计数/判定&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; E[&quot;按难度分级&lt;br/&gt;Easy/Medium/Hard&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    A[\"题目分类体系\"] --&gt; B[\"按数据结构&lt;br/&gt;数组/树/图/堆\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"按算法范式&lt;br/&gt;贪心/DP/搜索/分治\"]\n    A --&gt; D[\"按问题模式&lt;br/&gt;求最值/计数/判定\"]\n    A --&gt; E[\"按难度分级&lt;br/&gt;Easy/Medium/Hard\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分类维度</th>\n<th>主要类别</th>\n<th>识别信号</th>\n<th>优先尝试</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>数组、链表、树、图、堆、栈</td>\n<td>题目给定的数据类型</td>\n<td>该结构的经典操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算法范式</td>\n<td>贪心、DP、搜索、分治、数学</td>\n<td>问题的优化目标和约束</td>\n<td>范式的标准模板</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>问题模式</td>\n<td>求最值、计数、存在性、构造</td>\n<td>题目要求的输出类型</td>\n<td>对应的解法方向</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>复杂度要求</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>n</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n^2)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>输入规模 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 的范围</td>\n<td>符合复杂度的算法</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"按数据结构分类\">按数据结构分类</h2><p>数据结构是题目分类的第一维度——题目给定或隐含的数据结构直接限定了可用的算法。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ProblemCategory {&#10;  structure: string;&#10;  commonPatterns: string[];&#10;  keyAlgorithms: string[];&#10;}&#10;&#10;const structureCategories: ProblemCategory[] = [&#10;  {&#10;    structure: &#39;数组/字符串&#39;,&#10;    commonPatterns: [&#39;双指针&#39;, &#39;滑动窗口&#39;, &#39;前缀和&#39;, &#39;排序&#39;],&#10;    keyAlgorithms: [&#39;二分搜索&#39;, &#39;贪心&#39;, &#39;动态规划&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    structure: &#39;链表&#39;,&#10;    commonPatterns: [&#39;快慢指针&#39;, &#39;哨兵节点&#39;, &#39;反转&#39;, &#39;合并&#39;],&#10;    keyAlgorithms: [&#39;迭代&#39;, &#39;递归&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    structure: &#39;二叉树&#39;,&#10;    commonPatterns: [&#39;递归遍历&#39;, &#39;层序遍历&#39;, &#39;路径问题&#39;, &#39;构造&#39;],&#10;    keyAlgorithms: [&#39;DFS&#39;, &#39;BFS&#39;, &#39;分治&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    structure: &#39;图&#39;,&#10;    commonPatterns: [&#39;遍历&#39;, &#39;最短路&#39;, &#39;拓扑排序&#39;, &#39;连通性&#39;],&#10;    keyAlgorithms: [&#39;BFS&#39;, &#39;DFS&#39;, &#39;Dijkstra&#39;, &#39;并查集&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    structure: &#39;堆/优先队列&#39;,&#10;    commonPatterns: [&#39;Top-K&#39;, &#39;合并有序序列&#39;, &#39;中位数&#39;],&#10;    keyAlgorithms: [&#39;堆排序&#39;, &#39;多路归并&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;  {&#10;    structure: &#39;栈/队列&#39;,&#10;    commonPatterns: [&#39;括号匹配&#39;, &#39;单调栈&#39;, &#39;滑动窗口最值&#39;],&#10;    keyAlgorithms: [&#39;单调栈&#39;, &#39;单调队列&#39;],&#10;  },&#10;];\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProblemCategory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  structure</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  commonPatterns</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  keyAlgorithms</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> structureCategories</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ProblemCategory</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><